      "value": "Please. I don't want to make the bizarre arcane ritual I gotta follow every time I give eye tracking to an avatar. It shouldn't be so complicated when you already know where the eyes are. The funniest thing is that it actually uses the eyes defined in the avatar, it just WANTS to have some bones with a certain name or else it won't work.",
