  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "To implement eye movement, we have to make correct name and structure of the bones from \"Armature\" to \"LeftEye\" and \"RightEye\". But my modeling software cannot create the structures VRChat requires. Why not use the original humanoid rigs settings as they are? We set the bones properly for Humanoid rigs, isn't the bones of eyes actually working without match of names and structures? Other bones will work with different names and structures. I want the bones of eyes to be the same. Sorry for my English is poor.",
